channels.thermonuclear.reactor_pipe=Decides the tier of the reactor's main-structure and module pipe casings. Starts at §6Steel Pipe Casing§r at value 1 and ends at §6Tungstensteel Pipe Casing§r at value 3; the main structure and every module must use one single tier.
channels.thermonuclear.fuel_rod=Decides the tier of the reactor's fuel rod blocks. Starts at §6Tier 1 Fuel Rod Block§r at value 1 and ends at §6Tier 4 Fuel Rod Block§r at value 4; the main structure and every module must use one single tier, and the rods must stand upright.
channels.thermonuclear.turbine_shaft=Decides the tier of the turbine shaft. Starts at §6Low-Pressure Turbine Shaft§r at value 1 and ends at §6High-Pressure Turbine Shaft§r at value 2.
channels.thermonuclear.extra=Decides how many expansion modules the hologram and blueprint auto-build show as an example: §61§7 main structure only, §62§7 main structure plus one back module, §63§7 two consecutive back modules. Actual module connections are not restricted.
